# radroots_mesh_agent_proto

This is the README for `radroots_mesh_agent_proto`, which provides the mesh
agent protocol schema surface for the `radroots` core libraries.

## Overview

 * canonical Transport V1 Cap'n Proto schema text for the future
   `radroots.mesh_agent.v1` IPC surface, superseding earlier handoff draft
   schema text;
 * schema id and deterministic SHA-256 digest helpers;
 * narrow validation helpers for required request, response, status, Reticulum
   transport, publish placeholder, receipt, and error schema declarations;
 * schema-only protocol posture without an agent runtime or IPC client.

